-- title:
--   Original BV interior C1 localisation proves the exact raw stopped negative-jump signed real source series
-- statement:
--   For the genuine original bounded-variation spectrally negative Lévy and original admissible dividend process, on a fixed physical finite ruin/horizon clock and any compact C1 interior band, the actual discounted left-reserve nonlinear global NX jump integral is almost surely exactly its original stopped negative-mark jump-time signed real series. Original BV C1 compact interior localisation supplies the local Lipschitz and bounded-value bounds, while the separately Proved original same-path signed jump-series theorem supplies the equality. No auxiliary L,R or stochastic source assumption is left and the physical zero exclusion and final contact remain.

